@HostAddress = http://localhost:5080
@battleId = 0123456789abcdef

### Sign in first (Accounts/Http/Account.http → Login Account)
### Live battles go through the SignalR hub at /hubs/showdown, not through these endpoints.

### Status Battle
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/showdown/status

### List Battle (the 12 most recent)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/showdown/battles

### Replay Battle
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/showdown/battles/{{battleId}}

### FormatRecords Battle
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/showdown/me/stats
